Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 03:20:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 44/75] x86 AND/CMP -> CMP: never widen the compare, and narrow
 it only for unsigned/equality conditions on a constant in 0..mask

and $255,%eax / cmpl $100,%eax / jl was turned into cmpb $100,%al / jl,
so (a and $FF) < 100 was true for a = 200; and $65535,%eax / cmpb was
widened to cmpw.  Trunk only (optimisation added in ccbdfa9150, 2023).
Found by the pgen3 generator (seed 30227).
